# tally 2.1.8 R14, L §5.10, E §6.3: at a place of unit any each ledger is its unit's: EUR's balance line takes
# EUR's reading and pad only, PLN's PLN's.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit USD: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pad broker from world
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"
  stated[broker] = 3.00 PLN at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask r: residuals broker 2026-02
=== expect
r: residuals broker 2026-02
  ledger EUR:
    2026-02 balance: model 1.00 EUR, observed 4.00 EUR, difference 3.00 EUR
      balance broker 2026-02-15 end (padded): booked 1.00 EUR, stated 4.00 EUR, gap 3.00 EUR
  ledger PLN:
    2026-02 balance: model 2.00 PLN, observed 3.00 PLN, difference 1.00 PLN
      balance broker 2026-02-15 end (padded): booked 2.00 PLN, stated 3.00 PLN, gap 1.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-10
